# Kept out of the image: secrets, the user's projects (mounted as a volume at run time), installed packages (npm ci
# installs Linux builds), other sessions' worktrees and tool state, and research that the app never reads.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
node_modules
projects
.worktrees
.claude
bench/work
media
renders
out
research
docs
scripts
*.mp4
*.wav
*.log
